      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aníng ina báy, «Tláw, sirwír hhekw tlaxweek dír heé tleeusmowo, daqaní bariise báhh'alé nee kaahamuusér uren ar Mungú ka léhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ti alkoonde' ay baraá xatstá garmoó Hinomu, nee ta waarahhá' ar dír afkú ta bay Qambeesama'. Bar aga didií hardát, axweesante'eé' tidá' ni oó' ka dir'íní ó'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki beer, kuungaá waawituú Yuda nee yaamuloouusér Yerusalemu, iia qaasaak! AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Aleesleemusmo, Munguú múk Israeli, i kaahi, ‹Ar ló' amotlakwér tlakw ngi baraá yaamuukií huúw, umuú heé kaangwí gwaa axaasi i ló'wa da'ayuut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma mukwí aníng iga geexáy, nee yaamuuká' nga meeta gaasiyé' ar da/aa/ángw mooyaangw dír munguaá hatlá', munguiidá' inooín nee baabi'ii'ín, laqaá waawitaáín ta baloó xuiiká. Nee sleeme yaamuuká' nga hatsiisiyé' tseerdaá múk dakuús wasle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitángw ilahhooa oo mungú ta bay Ba'ali nguri tleehhiyé' as na/ii ngiwa da/aa/ana' adór ilahhooár da/a. Aníng adoorí aga hara'ayimiiká, laqaá iga kaangwí bawiiká, laqaá tam adoorí aga aldakwiiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, xuaak adór deelo nir hardát ar yaamuuká' kiwa malé bayká Tofeti, laqaá xatstá garmoó Hinomu, inós kan bay xatstá tsu/uta. Anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ tí ngina oó'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diirihe aníng múk Yuda nee oo Yerusalemu muruuín kudá' ta qoomeemesi un hhitiím. Aníng wakuuser'ín a baalírí haniís, nee inooín kiri tsuu/ baraá slaqwaraaro. Aníng tu'uuín in máw as tawa muruú /aymár tsir/o nee makaá sla/a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng gixsarí a dír de'e tlaaq tleéhh, nee gár ta waaqaseesen. Umuú heé waaraahha adoodá' birnga ár, iri da'ayuut nee gari waaqasén as slahh'amuudá' gaa slay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bál mukwí burkwa /amaatseék nee wakuuser'ín nee mukdá' gi baramaanuús nee kudá' gi tsu/utár wa slaá', mukwí tsaxwaá yaariir gi sláy, tam fu'unaá na/ii'ín awa daaqaay nee awa dasuwo kiri /aay, nee umuúqo heewo fu'unaá inslaawmoowós giri /aay.›",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
