          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Daqaní kuúng sirwidá' ka gás dír geraá mukdá' nee kuúng ti alkoomá' ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee ki beer, anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Aleesleemusmo a káh, ‹Adoorí an adór aníng mukwí ngur giqaw, nee gixsarí ngir hhaamiis, adór heé xooslmoó tleei ngwa gaas kudá' inki/isaro ta baloó aslayká. Tu'u kiri foliit baraá Tofeti, tam dír muu kway foliiti iri qwaát. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoorí an adoodá' ni tleehhár wa slaa' dír yaamuuká' nee dír yaamuloouuser'ín, gixsarí ngiri adór Tofeti tleéhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maraá Yerusalemu nee maraá waawituú Yuda, nee umuú do'o oo daárirós kawa mooyángw wa daá/ dír tsatse/ú doori, nee ilahhooadár tsipipi'iisa ar difaái kawa hanmiisi dír munguaá hatlá', marayká' sleémeero ki meetagaas adór didár Tofeti.› »",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Yeremia iri Tofetír wa tláy amoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngway ya/aáw iri aariirín. Inós iri tláy iri sihhiít baraá Doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, muu sleémeero guri báy, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Aleesleemusmo, Munguú múk Israeli, i kaahi, «Qaytsiít aníng muruudá' tlákw naa axweemamiís daanduú gixsarihe nee ayeemaá inslaawaywós sleémeerowo ngu huúw, asma inooín sager'ín ngina gawdeesiyé' nee axweesante'eé' ngi axamisiiaaká.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
